      <h2 id="hermes-guide-title">What does Hermes do, and which path should you choose?</h2>
      <p>Hermes coordinates four business directions: U.S. logistics, marketing, practical business education, and AI/web systems. The right path depends on whether you need freight or vehicle movement, customer acquisition, operational training, or a digital system that reduces manual work.</p>
    </div>

    <nav aria-label="Hermes guide contents" class="authority-toc">
      <strong>On this page</strong>
      <a href="#hermes-definitions">Definitions</a>
